Privacy Policy – Sleep Timer
Privacy Policy

Effective Date: August 24, 2026

Sleep Timer ("the App") is a simple timer application that allows users to set a duration and start a countdown timer.

Information We Collect

We do not collect, store, transmit, or share any personal information or user data.

The App does not require an account, registration, or login.

How the App Works

You select a time or duration, and the App starts a countdown timer. The timer runs on your device and ends when it reaches zero.

Any information required to operate the timer is processed locally on your device.

Third-Party Services

The App does not use third-party services that collect personal user information.

Data Sharing

We do not sell, share, or transfer user data to third parties because we do not collect any user data.

Children's Privacy

The App does not knowingly collect information from children or any other users.

Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy if the App's functionality changes. Any updates will be posted with a new effective date.

